SQL> -- issue #362: a json_table that depends on a column of its join partner must not be planned as
SQL> -- the build(inner) side of a hash/merge join. force the join method choice via enable_nestloop_join.
SQL> alter table test_jsonb_table add column f3 varchar(8000);

Succeed.

